# Personal working notes and AI handoff docs. Kept on disk, out of the repo:
# they carry folder names, drive names and working habits that a shared tool
# has no reason to publish. Untracked with `git rm --cached`, since .gitignore
# alone does not stop git tracking a file it already knows about.
